# accepted). 888, option 1: TuningOut_Progress 1, begun (any option). Accepted: 889. TuningOut_Progress 8 (GM: the
# Kazham, Norg, Beaucedine Glacier and Yuhtunga Jungle steps stay Lua): 897 with a full inventory: npcUtil.completeQuest
# refuses (the Cache-Nez does not fit): still accepted, progress 8; with room: the Cache-Nez, Friend of the Helmed, fame
# 40, completed, progress 0. Completed: nothing.
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=12.9,-9.7,-197.5 job=WAR lvl=75
quest Windurst.TuningIn completed
item MagickedSteelIngot
item PieceOfSpruceLumber
item ExtraFineFile
login
trade Leepe-Hoppe MagickedSteelIngot x1 PieceOfSpruceLumber x1 ExtraFineFile x1  # Tuning In completed: nothing
